### 2. 🎯 API Endpoints

| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |
|----------|--------|---------|
| `/health` | GET | Check API health status |
| `/generate-plant-guide` | POST | Generate comprehensive plant care guide |
| `/` | GET | API information and available endpoints |
| `/docs` | GET | Interactive API documentation (Swagger) |
| `/redoc` | GET | Alternative API documentation |

### 3. 📊 Request/Response Structure

**Input Schema (PlantInputData):**
- plant_name (string, 1-100 chars)
- plant_type (string, 1-50 chars)
- climate (string, 1-50 chars)
- sunlight_hours (integer, 0-24)
- soil_type (string, 1-50 chars)
- watering_frequency (string, 1-50 chars)
- experience_level (string, 1-50 chars)

**Output Schema (PlantGuideResponse):**
- success (boolean)
- plant_care_guidance (GeminiResponse)
  - plant_overview
  - growth_stages[]
  - daily_care
  - common_problems[]
  - additional_tips[]
- visual_guide (NotebookLMResponse)
  - status
  - file_url
  - file_type
  - message
- metadata
  - timestamp
  - processing_time_seconds
  - plant_name
  - ai_model
  - version

